invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_cfg.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: a configuration with an anchor count but no anchor list passes as
  pins alone, so a field missing from an anchor configuration drops
  the chain check without a word. The half-anchor rows object.

--- old
    return cfg->spki_pin_count > 0 && cfg->anchors == NULL && cfg->anchor_count == 0;
--- new
    return cfg->spki_pin_count > 0 && cfg->anchors == NULL;
